    content: `<p><b>Provisional Nature of Employment</b><br>Your engagement with AUXOSYS ("the Company") is strictly provisional and subject to satisfactory completion of all mandatory document submissions and background verification checks. Until all verification processes are completed successfully, your internship/employment status shall remain temporary, and the Company reserves the right to withdraw or revoke this offer at any point during this period without liability.</p><p><b>Mandatory Documentation</b><br>As part of the onboarding and background verification process, you are required to submit the following essential documents within the timeframe specified by the Company (please refer to Annexure A: Required Documents for Verification for a detailed list and formats):<ul><li><b>Identity Proof:</b> Valid government-issued identification such as Aadhaar Card, PAN Card, Passport, or Driving License for verification of your identity and personal details.</li><li><b>Academic Credentials:</b> Copies of certificates, mark sheets, degrees, diplomas, or transcripts that substantiate your educational qualifications as claimed during the application and selection process.</li><li><b>Background Check Documents:</b> Additional documents as may be necessary for conducting background verifications, including, but not limited to, previous employment records, references, and police verification clearance, depending on the role and project requirements.</li><li><b>Declaration of No Criminal Record:</b> A signed declaration affirming that you have no pending criminal cases, convictions, or legal restrictions that could impact your ability to serve in the Company or contravene Company policies.</li></ul></p><p><b>Verification Process</b><ul><li>The Company, through authorised third-party agencies or internal teams, will carry out comprehensive background verification checks based on the submitted documentation.</li><li>This process will include cross-verification of identity, educational qualifications, employment history (if applicable), and criminal record checks where relevant.</li><li>You are required to cooperate fully and provide any additional information or clarification requested during the verification process.</li></ul></p><p><b>Consequences of Misrepresentation or Incomplete Submission</b><ul><li>Any submission of forged, fabricated, inaccurate, or misleading documents will be regarded as a severe breach of trust and professional ethics.</li><li>Such acts will lead to immediate revocation of the offer of internship/employment or termination of services if already onboarded, without any further obligation on the part of the Company.</li><li>The Company reserves the right to initiate legal proceedings, including criminal prosecution under relevant sections of the Indian Penal Code (IPC) and the Information Technology Act, for fraud, misrepresentation, and forgery.</li><li>Additionally, such violations may result in permanent blacklisting from future engagements with AUXOSYS and its affiliates.</li></ul></p><p><b>Retention of Documents</b><ul><li>The Company shall retain copies of all submitted documents and verification reports securely for its records, in compliance with applicable data protection and privacy laws.</li><li>These documents will be treated with strict confidentiality and used solely for employment-related purposes.</li></ul></p>`,
